1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:01,400
If you want
to go from this

2
00:00:01,400 --> 00:00:02,000
to this

3
00:00:02,000 --> 00:00:03,500
drink this
every morning

4
00:00:03,500 --> 00:00:04,500
First in a glass

5
00:00:04,500 --> 00:00:06,800
mix a teaspoon
of turmeric with

6
00:00:06,800 --> 00:00:08,800
a good pinch
of black pepper

7
00:00:08,800 --> 00:00:10,000
and warm water

8
00:00:10,000 --> 00:00:11,500
Then add
a spoon of honey

9
00:00:11,500 --> 00:00:12,300
squeeze in

10
00:00:12,300 --> 00:00:13,400
fresh lemon juice

11
00:00:13,400 --> 00:00:15,000
and give it all
a quick stir

12
00:00:15,000 --> 00:00:16,400
Now the part
most people skip

13
00:00:16,400 --> 00:00:18,400
drop in a few
threads of saffron

14
00:00:18,400 --> 00:00:19,600
That's the one

15
00:00:19,600 --> 00:00:20,900
that really makes
the difference

16
00:00:20,900 --> 00:00:22,000
Listen to me

17
00:00:22,000 --> 00:00:22,900
follow me

18
00:00:22,900 --> 00:00:24,800
or I won't be
able to reach you
